{"url": "https://webaim.org/articles/cognitive/media/graphic.htm", "silo": "webaim", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><title>William Shakespeare</title>\n\n<link href=\"/styles/examplestyles.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n</head>\n\n<body>\n<p><img src=\"shakespeare.jpg\" alt=\"portrait of William Shakespeare\" style=\"float:left;margin:5px;\" height=\"282\" width=\"200\"></p>\n<p>What is being said in this phrase? <strong>Tob eornot obe </strong></p>\n<p>Can you read it now?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>It says, \"To be or not to be.\"</p>\n<p>Use the back button on your browser to return to the article. </p>\n</body></html>", "links": []}